kers left.\n\nThe last play is **RedJoker** (single highest card). To beat it, you would need **BlackJoker**, which you\'ve already played. You don’t have it. No bomb was played before, so no bomb can overtake now unless led anew.\n\nThus, **no card or combination in your hand can beat RedJoker** because:\n- Only BlackJoker or a bomb/rocket can beat RedJoker.\n- You have neither BlackJoker nor a bomb (four of a kind) nor a rocket.\n\nTherefore, **you cannot beat RedJoker**.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
