ure and allows my teammate to respond with other low cards if they’re trying to shed them. It avoids prematurely escalating the round with high cards like Kings or Jacks, preserving strength for later critical moments. Given that both opponents passed last turn, the flow is currently open, and starting small increases the chance of letting my teammate take control next.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3"]}'}
